# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Error mitigation and error suppression techniques are used to improve result quality when scaling up to larger workloads. This page provides high-level explanations for several of the error suppression and error mitigation techniques available with the Qiskit SDK and the IBM Quantum Compute service.\n"
msgstr "Teknik mitigasi ralat dan penindasan ralat digunakan untuk meningkatkan kualiti keputusan apabila menskalakan kepada beban kerja yang lebih besar. Halaman ini menyediakan penjelasan tahap tinggi tentang beberapa teknik penindasan ralat dan mitigasi ralat yang tersedia dengan Qiskit SDK dan perkhidmatan IBM Quantum Compute.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"New execution model, now in beta release\">\n"
"The beta release of a new execution model is now available. The directed execution model provides more flexibility when customizing your error mitigation workflow. See the [Directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model) guide for more information.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Model pelaksanaan baharu, kini dalam keluaran beta\">\n"
"Keluaran beta model pelaksanaan baharu kini tersedia. Model pelaksanaan terarah menyediakan lebih banyak fleksibiliti apabila menyesuaikan aliran kerja mitigasi ralat anda. Lihat panduan [Model pelaksanaan terarah](/guides/directed-execution-model) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
